+    // Record = eager pipelined fence: put the fence request for this marker
+    // on the wire now (its deferred response is the ticket a later wait
+    // pops), then snapshot the resulting position. Without the ticket, the
+    // wait-side fence could only wait for the WHOLE queue, which serializes
+    // a deep pipeline right back to depth one.
